    "purpose": "Closed list of valid `primary_theme` values plus hand-curated first-order / second-order / ticker_seed mappings. Loaded into the `theme_registry` table at startup; referenced by the consequence-mapping resolver to insert `situation_exposure` rows with source_method='hand_curated'.",
    "philosophy": "Tier 1 of the hybrid mapping strategy: deterministic, high-traffic, audit-ready. Themes outside this list fall through to Tier 2 (LLM-assist with confidence-discount). Bias toward themes Camillo would actually call out — directional and consequential, not descriptive.",
